1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,887
Ugochukwu needs help with his school fees,

2
00:00:02,887 --> 00:00:04,509
and so having created an account,

3
00:00:04,509 --> 00:00:07,227
he signs up to the website and goes ahead
to create a cause.

4
00:00:07,950 --> 00:00:09,908
As you can see, he doesn't just fill a
form.

5
00:00:09,908 --> 00:00:11,515
This is an interview with AI,

6
00:00:11,515 --> 00:00:14,280
and that is a real live model answering.

7
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,612
It asks for what exactly the money is for.

8
00:00:16,612 --> 00:00:17,974
It asks for who exactly gets paid,

9
00:00:17,974 --> 00:00:19,978
how much will be paid, and when exactly
the money is due.

10
00:00:19,978 --> 00:00:22,583
You can see it asks for the Remita
reference

11
00:00:22,583 --> 00:00:25,044
in this case, because he claims to be a

12
00:00:25,044 --> 00:00:26,712
student of a federal university who wants
to pay

13
00:00:26,712 --> 00:00:27,885
his fees.

14
00:00:27,885 --> 00:00:29,973
This is the detail that he cannot forge,

15
00:00:29,973 --> 00:00:31,893
and even if it seems like the AI
interviewer

16
00:00:31,893 --> 00:00:33,492
isn't thorough in drilling him for
document proofs and

17
00:00:33,492 --> 00:00:36,105
the like, it notes this verifiable detail
and goes

18
00:00:36,105 --> 00:00:38,127
ahead to create the case for him.

19
00:00:38,837 --> 00:00:41,632
And then out comes the published itemised
budget,

20
00:00:41,632 --> 00:00:43,377
with the receiver of the money clearly
stated.

21
00:00:43,377 --> 00:00:45,563
In this case, three hundred thousand naira
to be

22
00:00:45,563 --> 00:00:47,092
paid to the University of Lagos.

23
00:00:48,051 --> 00:00:49,210
He then proves who he is,

24
00:00:49,210 --> 00:00:51,190
with his NIN and his face matched against
the

25
00:00:51,190 --> 00:00:52,264
registry.

26
00:00:52,264 --> 00:00:54,565
This is important, because an NIN number
can be

27
00:00:54,565 --> 00:00:55,791
leaked, but not a live face.

28
00:00:56,481 --> 00:00:58,088
And this is where it runs the fraud check.

29
00:00:58,088 --> 00:01:00,838
It scans for reused images, contradictory
dates and unrealistic

30
00:01:00,838 --> 00:01:03,566
budgets, and also in this case a valid
Remita

31
00:01:03,566 --> 00:01:05,552
number that is actually owned by
Ugochukwu.

32
00:01:06,267 --> 00:01:08,492
Now, we see a donor named Okefe,

33
00:01:08,492 --> 00:01:10,945
who gives a hundred and fifty thousand
naira.

34
00:01:10,945 --> 00:01:13,116
Before he agreed, he is shown what we
would take.

35
00:01:13,116 --> 00:01:16,620
This is tentatively two percent, capped at
five thousand naira.

36
00:01:16,620 --> 00:01:19,588
All this lands in escrow, not in Ugo's
account.

37
00:01:19,871 --> 00:01:21,645
Now, on the left is Ugochukwu's account,

38
00:01:21,645 --> 00:01:23,596
and on the right is another potential
donor,

39
00:01:23,596 --> 00:01:24,943
namely Abigail.

40
00:01:24,943 --> 00:01:28,654
These are two separate browsers with the
named accounts logged in.

41
00:01:28,654 --> 00:01:32,058
Now as you can see, a hundred

42
00:01:32,058 --> 00:01:33,796
and forty seven thousand naira has been
raised by

43
00:01:33,796 --> 00:01:35,182
Okefe, and a hundred and fifty three
thousand naira

44
00:01:35,182 --> 00:01:36,081
is still needed.

45
00:01:37,642 --> 00:01:39,265
Abigail donates this balance.

46
00:01:39,265 --> 00:01:40,994
Before she agrees to pay, notice that she
is

47
00:01:40,994 --> 00:01:42,685
told what portion of the amount will be
taken

48
00:01:42,685 --> 00:01:43,774
to maintain the app.

49
00:01:43,774 --> 00:01:46,654
As earlier mentioned, this is our
tentative business model.

50
00:01:46,654 --> 00:01:48,193
We resort to this when we are unable to

51
00:01:48,193 --> 00:01:49,618
get any sponsors at all.

52
00:01:51,873 --> 00:01:53,541
Notice also that as soon as she gives this

53
00:01:53,541 --> 00:01:57,082
money, it updates automatically
everywhere, and Ugo gets a

54
00:01:57,082 --> 00:01:59,566
notification that his money is complete.

55
00:02:01,058 --> 00:02:02,773
Now, let's look at Ugo's wallet.

56
00:02:02,773 --> 00:02:04,596
Notice that this money does not land in
Ugo's

57
00:02:04,596 --> 00:02:07,519
account, neither can Ugo even withdraw any
of it.

58
00:02:07,519 --> 00:02:10,489
The money is kept in escrow with a
licensed

59
00:02:10,489 --> 00:02:12,394
partner, and Ugo cannot touch any of it.

60
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:15,639
He clicks on Pay fees, and the AI,

61
00:02:15,639 --> 00:02:17,612
after getting results from the API,

62
00:02:17,612 --> 00:02:20,865
confirms the biller, the amount, and
checks if it

63
00:02:20,865 --> 00:02:22,913
is unpaid, and then it settles it.

64
00:02:22,913 --> 00:02:24,910
We then get a receipt from the university.

65
00:02:26,372 --> 00:02:27,050
As soon as this payment is made,

66
00:02:27,050 --> 00:02:31,073
Abigail gets notified that Ugo's fees has
been paid,

67
00:02:31,073 --> 00:02:32,665
as well as a breakdown of what portion of

68
00:02:32,665 --> 00:02:34,371
her donation paid the fees.

69
00:02:34,371 --> 00:02:35,811
She does not just get a thank you,

70
00:02:35,811 --> 00:02:38,583
she gets a receipt, one that she can
inspect herself.

